<article class="faq-entry">
<h2>Why does the 50cc cost more per day than the Honda Click?</h2>
<p>The Click sits in the entry tier at 150,000 VND per day, while the 50cc sits in the step-up tier at 200,000 VND. The 50,000 VND premium buys the lightest, simplest machine class in the fleet, aimed at new and cautious city riders.</p>
</article>
<article class="faq-entry">
<h2>Does the 200,000 VND daily rate include a helmet and deposit terms?</h2>
<p>Inclusions, deposits and gear terms belong to the shop’s rental policy, so confirm them at the counter at pickup. This guide publishes only verified prices and does not state what the rate includes beyond the machine.</p>
</article>
<article class="faq-entry">
<h2>What if I need the 50cc for three or four days?</h2>
<p>The honest floor is the verified 200,000 VND daily rate multiplied by the days, but ask the shop about multi-day or longer-term terms first. Longer 50cc arrangements are quoted directly rather than published as verified figures, and one short message settles the question before the first day begins.</p>
</article>
